hadiths[37]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4151","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein subah ka aik phera ya shaam ka aik phera duniya aur jo kuch us mein hai us se behtar hai."
"4152","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein subah ka aik phera ya shaam ka aik phera us har cheez se behtar hai jis par suraj tuloo hua aur ghuroob hua."
"4153","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nabiyon mein se aik Nabi ne jihad kiya to unhon ne apni qaum se kaha: Tum mein se mere peeche wo shakhs na aaye jis ne kisi aurat se nikah kiya ho aur us se ghar basane ka irada rakhta ho lekin abhi ghar na basaya ho, aur na wo jis ne makaan banaye hon lekin un ki chhatein na uthayi hon, aur na wo jis ne bakriyan ya haamila oontniyan kharidi hon aur un ke bachche dene ka muntazir ho. Pas unhon ne jihad kiya aur namaz-e-asr ke waqt ya us ke qareeb basti ke nazdeek pahunche to unhon ne suraj se kaha: Tum bhi hukm ki paband ho aur main bhi hukm ka paband hun; ae Allah, use hamare liye rok de. Pas wo rok di gayi yahan tak ke Allah ne unhein fatah di. Phir unhon ne ghanimat jama ki to aag aayi taake use kha jaye lekin us ne use na khaya. To unhon ne kaha: Tum mein khayanat hai; pas har qabile mein se aik aadmi meri baiat kare. To aik aadmi ka haath un ke haath se chipak gaya to unhon ne kaha: Khayanat tumhi mein hai; pas tumhara qabila meri baiat kare. To do ya teen aadmiyon ke haath un ke haath se chipak gaye to unhon ne kaha: Khayanat tumhi mein hai. Pas wo gaaye ke sar jaisa sone ka sar le aaye aur use rakh diya to aag aayi aur use kha gayi. Phir Allah ne hamare liye ghanimat halal kar di; us ne hamari kamzori aur aajizi dekhi to use hamare liye halal kar diya."
"4154","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Samundar mein aik jihad khushki mein das jihad se behtar hai, aur jo samundar paar kare goya us ne tamam wadiyan paar kar lein, aur us mein safar ke dauran ulti karne wala apne khoon mein tarapne wale ki tarah hai."
"4155","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma ke din ghusl har baaligh par wajib hai."
"4156","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhein fitne andheri raat ke tukron ki tarah gher lenge; un mein sab se zyada nijaat pane wala wo shakhs hoga jo pahar ki choti wala ho jo apni bakriyon ke doodh se khaye, ya wo shakhs jo raston ke peeche apne ghore ki lagaam pakre hue ho jo apni talwar se khaye."
"4157","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni raan dhaanp lo, kyunke raan satr hai."
"4158","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni raan dhaanp lo, kyunke mard ki raan us ke satr mein se hai."
"4159","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bartan dhaanp diya karo aur mashkize ka munh bandh diya karo, kyunke saal mein aik raat aisi hai jis mein waba utarti hai; wo kisi khule bartan ya khule mashkize par se nahi guzarti magar us waba mein se kuch us mein pad jata hai."
"4160","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bartan dhaanp diya karo, mashkize bandh diya karo, darwaze band kar diya karo aur chiragh bujha diya karo, kyunke shaitan na mashkiza kholta hai na darwaza kholta hai na bartan kholta hai. Phir agar tum mein se koi lakri ke siwa kuch na paye jo apne bartan par rakh sake to Allah ka naam lekar aisa kar le, kyunke chuuhiya ghar walon par un ka ghar jala deti hai."
"4161","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghifar, Allah use bakhsh de; Aslam, Allah use salamat rakhe; aur Usayya ne Allah aur us ke Rasool ki nafarmani ki."
"4162","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne tum se pehle logon mein se aik shakhs ko bakhsh diya jo bechne mein narm tha, kharidne mein narm tha aur taqaza karne mein narm tha."
"4163","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik bad-kaar aurat ko bakhsh diya gaya jo aik kutte ke paas se guzri jo kunwen ke kinare hanp raha tha aur pyas use halak karne wali thi; pas us ne apna moza utara aur use apni odhni se bandha aur us ke liye pani nikala to us ki wajah se use bakhsh diya gaya."
"4164","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sakht-dili aur durushti mashriq walon mein hai, aur iman aur sukoon Hijaz walon mein hai."
"4165","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dajjal ke siwa mujhe apni ummat par Dajjal se zyada khauf gumrah karne wale imaamon ka hai."
"4166","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dajjal ke siwa jo cheez mujhe tum par sab se zyada khauf dilati hai ye hai ke agar wo nikle aur main tum mein hun to main tumhari taraf se us se jhagrun ga, aur agar wo nikle aur main tum mein na hun to har shakhs apni taraf se jhagrega, aur Allah har Musalman par mera khalifa hai. Wo ghungrale baalon wala jawan hai, us ki aik aankh aisi hai jaise ubhri hui angoor; goya main use Abd-ul-Uzza bin Qatan se mushabeh pata hun. Pas tum mein se jo use paye wo us par Surah Kahf ki ibtidayi aayatein parhe. Wo Shaam aur Iraq ke darmiyan aik raaste se niklega aur dayen bayen fasad phelayega; ae Allah ke bando, sabit qadam rehna. Sahaba ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, zameen mein us ka theharna kitna hoga? Farmaya: Chalis din: aik din saal jaisa, aik din mahine jaisa, aik din hafte jaisa aur baaqi din tumhare dinon jaise. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, to wo din jo saal jaisa hoga kiya us mein hamare liye aik din ki namaz kafi hogi? Farmaya: Nahi, us ka andaza laga lena. Unhon ne kaha: Aur zameen mein us ki raftaar kiya hogi? Farmaya: Baarish ki tarah jis ke peeche hawa ho. Wo aik qaum par aayega aur unhein dawat dega to wo us par iman layenge aur us ki baat manenge; phir wo aasman ko hukm dega to baarish hogi aur zameen ko to wo ugayegi; phir un ke maweshi shaam ko un ke paas is haal mein lautenge ke un ki kokhein sab se lambi, than sab se bhare hue aur kohane sab se phaili hui hongi. Phir wo aik qaum par aayega aur unhein dawat dega to wo us ki baat radd kar denge; phir wo un se wapas jayega to wo subah is haal mein karenge ke qehet-zada honge aur un ke maalon mein se kuch un ke haathon mein na hoga. Aur wo veeran zameen par guzrega aur us se kahega: Apne khazane nikaal; to us ke khazane us ke peeche aise chalenge jaise shehad ki makkhiyon ke sardar. Phir wo aik bharpur jawan mard ko bulayega aur use talwar marega aur use do tukre kar dega jaise nishane par teer lagta hai; phir use bulayega to wo aayega aur us ka chehra khil raha hoga aur wo hans raha hoga. Pas jab wo isi haal mein hoga ke Allah Maseeh Ibn Maryam ko bheje ga; wo Dimashq ke mashriq mein safed minar ke paas utrenge, do rangay hue kapron mein, apni hatheliyan do farishton ke paron par rakhe hue; jab apna sar jhukayenge to qatre tapkenge aur jab use uthayenge to us se moti jaise chamakdar daane beh niklenge. Koi kafir jis tak un ke saans ki khushbu pahunchegi mare baghair na rahega, aur un ki saans wahan tak pahunchegi jahan tak un ki nazar pahunchegi. Phir wo use talash karenge yahan tak ke use Bab-e-Ludd par pa lenge aur use qatl kar denge. Phir Isa ke paas aik qaum aayegi jinhein Allah ne us se mehfooz rakha hoga; wo un ke chehron par haath pherenge aur unhein jannat mein un ke darjon ki khabar denge. Pas jab wo isi haal mein honge ke Allah Isa ki taraf wahi karega: Maine aise bande nikale hain jin se ladne ki kisi mein taqat nahi; pas mere bandon ko Toor ki taraf panaah mein le jao. Aur Allah Yaajooj aur Maajooj ko bhejega aur wo har bulandi se daurte hue niklenge. Un ke agle Tabariyya ki jheel par guzrenge aur jo kuch us mein hoga pi jayenge, aur un ke pichhle guzrenge to kahenge: Kabhi yahan pani tha. Phir wo chalte rahenge yahan tak ke Khamr ke pahar par pahunch jayenge jo Bait-ul-Maqdis ka pahar hai, aur kahenge: Ham ne zameen walon ko qatl kar diya, aao ab aasman walon ko qatl karein. Pas wo apne teer aasman ki taraf phenkenge to Allah un ke teer un ki taraf khoon mein range hue lauta dega. Aur Allah ke Nabi Isa aur un ke saathi gher liye jayenge yahan tak ke un mein se aik ke liye bail ka sar aaj tum mein se aik ke liye sau deenaron se behtar hoga. Phir Allah ke Nabi Isa aur un ke saathi Allah ki taraf ragbat karenge to Allah un ki gardanon mein keere bhejega to wo subah is haal mein karenge ke aik jaan ki maut mare hue honge. Phir Allah ke Nabi Isa aur un ke saathi zameen ki taraf utrenge to zameen mein baalisht bhar jagah bhi aisi na payenge jo un ki badbu aur taaffun se bhari na ho. Phir Allah ke Nabi Isa aur un ke saathi Allah azza wa jal ki taraf ragbat karenge to Allah Bukhti oonton ki gardanon jaise parinde bhejega jo unhein uthayenge aur jahan Allah chahega phenk denge. Phir Allah baarish bheje ga jis se kachchi eenton ka ghar bachega na baalon ka khema, aur wo zameen ko dho degi yahan tak ke use aaine ki tarah saaf chhor degi. Phir zameen se kaha jayega: Apna phal ugaa aur apni barkat lauta. To us din aik jamaat aik anaar se khayegi aur us ke chhilke se saya hasil karegi, aur doodh mein barkat di jayegi yahan tak ke oontni ka aik dodh dene wala janwar logon ki bari jamaat ko kafi hoga, gaaye ka dodh dene wala janwar qabile ko kafi hoga aur bakri ka dodh dene wala janwar khandan ko kafi hoga. Pas jab wo isi haal mein honge ke Allah paakiza hawa bheje ga jo unhein un ki baghlon ke neeche se pakregi aur har momin aur har Musalman ki rooh qabz kar legi, aur bure tareen log baaqi reh jayenge jo gadon ki tarah aapas mein khule aam milenge; pas unhi par qayamat qaim hogi."
"4167","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Safed baalon ko badal diya karo aur Yahudiyon se mushabehat na karo."
"4168","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Safed baalon ko badal diya karo aur Yahudiyon aur Nasraniyon se mushabehat na karo."
"4169","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Safed baalon ko badal do aur unhein siyahi ke qareeb na karo."
"4170","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke sar ko kisi cheez se badal do aur siyahi se bacho."
"4171","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jal ki raah mein jihad karne wala, hajj karne wala aur umrah karne wala Allah ke mehman hain; us ne unhein bulaya to unhon ne jawab diya aur unhon ne us se manga to us ne unhein ata kiya."
"4172","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Doobne wala shaheed hai aur jalne wala shaheed hai, ... aur pait ki beemari se marne wala shaheed hai, aur jis par makaan gir jaye wo shaheed hai،....... aur jo apni jaan ki hifazat mein qatl ho wo shaheed hai ... ..."
"4173","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein doobne wala shaheed hai."
"4174","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jihad do qism ka hai: raha wo jis ne Allah taala ki raza chahte hue jihad kiya, imam ki itaat ki, umda maal kharch kiya, shareek ke saath aasani ki aur zameen mein fasad se bacha, to us ka sona aur jaagna sab ajr hai; aur raha wo jis ne fakhr, riya aur shohrat ke liye jihad kiya, imam ki nafarmani ki aur zameen mein fasad phelaya, to wo barabari par bhi wapas nahi aayega."
"4175","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghusl aik saa hai aur wuzu aik mudd hai."
"4176","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Murde ko nehlane se ghusl hai aur use uthane se wuzu hai."
"4177","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma ke din ghusl har baaligh par wajib hai, aur miswak, aur khushbu mein se jitni muyassar ho lagaye agarche aurat ki khushbu mein se ho."
"4178","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma ke din ghusl har baaligh par wajib hai, aur ke miswak kare aur khushbu lagaye agar paye."
"4179","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paidawar zamanat ke badle hai."
"4180","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakriyan barkat hain."
"4181","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakriyan barkat hain, oont apne walon ke liye izzat hain aur ghoron ki peshaniyon mein qayamat ke din tak bhalayi bandhi hui hai،..... ..."
"4182","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakriyan jannat ke janwaron mein se hain; pas un ki naak ki mitti ponchh diya karo aur un ke baithne ki jaghon mein namaz parha karo."
"4183","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ladka jise Khizr ne qatl kiya tha jis din paida hua kafir paida hua tha, aur agar wo zinda rehta to apne walidain ko sarkashi aur kufr mein daal deta."
"4184","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bachcha apne aqiqah ke badle girwi hai; us ki taraf se saatwein din zibah kiya jaye, us ka naam rakha jaye aur us ka sar mundwaya jaye."
"4185","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bachcha apne aqiqah ke badle girwi hai; pas us ki taraf se khoon bahao aur us se takleef door karo."
"4186","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghibat ye hai ke tum aadmi ka zikr us mein maujood aib ke saath us ki peeth peeche karo."
"4187","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghibat tumhara apne bhai ka zikr us baat ke saath karna hai jise wo na-pasand karta ho."
